<div class="intro">
  <p class="intro-lede">
    This blog doesn’t have a subject. It’s somewhere to put down whatever
    seemed worth putting down at the time — no schedule, no fixed direction,
    no promise that one post has anything to do with the last.
  </p>
  <p>
    Names and identifying details are changed when I write about other people.
    Comments are open and nobody’s screening them. Typos get fixed quietly;
    anything I change substantively gets a note saying so.
  </p>
</div>
